backoff~=2.2.1
# httpx is pinned in requirements-base.in (the template declares it because
# app/services imports it directly, and gundi-client-v2 3.x requires the 0.28
# line). Declaring it here as well meant every template bump of it landed as a
# resolver conflict on sync; this connector's use is plain AsyncClient/Timeout/
# error types, which 0.28 keeps.
